  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "The note addressed to Samuel",
      "path": "sams-calendar/README.DOC",
      "text": "Dere Samuel.....I found most of this stuff on an old floppy disc.\nDid a little bit of repair work but not all. Primarily you need to adjust\nand/or replace data in the data files which no longer pertain  to the\ncurrent time frame. It's a beautiful little program that is impossible to\nfigure out why it works...all I know is that it does. At least until the end of the millenium, when the left$ of the Date$ turn\nto zeroes...probably have to enter the year date manually....or something.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t¿QUIEN SABé\n\t\t\t\t"
    },
    {
